<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: We have a special connection with the anima nexus trees. The trees refocus production easily under our influence, and we are not satisfied unless we have that connection. -->
  <GauranlenConnection_Strong.description>Temos uma conexão especial com as árvores de nexo anima. Sob nossa influência, as árvores mudam facilmente o foco de sua produção, e não nos sentimos satisfeitos sem essa conexão.</GauranlenConnection_Strong.description>

  <!-- EN: <li>Anima nexus connection</li><li>Want anima nexus connection (min expectation: Very low)</li><li>Want anima nexus connection (min expectation: Low)</li><li>Want anima nexus connection (min expectation: Moderate)</li><li>Want anima nexus connection (min expectation: High)</li><li>Want anima nexus connection (min expectation: Sky high)</li> -->
  <!-- EN: Anima nexus connection -->
  <GauranlenConnection_Strong.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>Conexão com nexo anima</GauranlenConnection_Strong.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>

  <!-- EN: Want anima nexus connection (min expectation: Very low) -->
  <GauranlenConnection_Strong.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>Deseja conexão com nexo anima (expectativa mín.: Muito baixa)</GauranlenConnection_Strong.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>

  <!-- EN: Want anima nexus connection (min expectation: Low) -->
